---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {content} from '../data/i18n';
const {lang,company,path}=content(Astro.url);const z=lang==='zh';const L=(en:string,zh:string)=>z?zh:en;
const sections=[
 ['Who We Are','我们是谁',`This website is operated for ${company.name.replace(/\.$/,'')}. For privacy questions, contact ${company.email}. Our business address is ${company.address}.`,`本网站用于云辇新材料科技（广州）有限公司的产品展示与业务联系。隐私问题请发送邮件至 ${company.email}。公司地址：${company.address}。`],
 ['Information You Choose To Provide','您主动提供的信息','Our inquiry form asks for your name, business email, company, country or region, product interests and any message you enter. You may also provide information when contacting us by email or WhatsApp. Please only share information needed for your business inquiry, and do not include payment-card details or sensitive personal information.','询价表单包括姓名、业务邮箱、公司、国家或地区、意向产品及您填写的留言。通过邮件或 WhatsApp 联系时，您也可能主动提供信息。请只提供业务沟通所需内容，不要填写银行卡资料或敏感个人信息。'],
 ['Website Chat','官网聊天','When you send a chat message, Groq processes it with recent conversation context and public product information. We store conversations on Cloudflare for support and keep regular chat context for up to 30 days of active service. Inquiries referred to our team and contact details you submit are retained separately for follow-up. A session identifier in your browser tab keeps the conversation together.','发送消息时，Groq 会结合近期对话和公开产品资料生成回复。云辇使用 Cloudflare 存储客服记录，常规上下文在服务运行期间保留最多 30 天。需要跟进的询价和您主动提交的联系方式会单独保留，供团队处理。浏览器标签页使用会话标识衔接对话。'],
 ['How The Inquiry Form Works','询价表单如何工作','The form prepares a message in your browser. It does not automatically email us or submit your details to a website database. When you choose email or WhatsApp, the prepared message is handed to that service; you can review it before sending. Form contents are not saved by this site to browser storage.','表单在您的浏览器中整理询价信息，不会自动发送邮件，也不会将内容直接提交到本网站数据库。选择邮件或 WhatsApp 后，消息会交给对应服务，您可检查后自行发送。本网站不将表单内容保存到浏览器存储。'],
 ['Your Color Shortlist','您的选色清单','If you save colors, this site stores only their catalog identifiers in this browser so the shortlist survives a page change or refresh. You can remove entries or clear the shortlist in the color catalog. Selected identifiers also appear in an inquiry link. Contact details and message text are not saved with this list.','保存颜色时，本网站仅将所选产品的目录标识保存在当前浏览器，便于切换页面或刷新后继续选色。您可在色卡目录中移除颜色或清空清单。选中的目录标识也会出现在询价链接中；清单不保存联系方式或消息正文。'],
 ['Why Information Is Used','信息用途','Information you send is used to respond to inquiries, discuss samples and quotations, evaluate the product or OEM requirements you request, and manage related business correspondence. Technical access information may be processed by the hosting provider to deliver pages, maintain security and diagnose errors. This website does not sell inquiry data or use it for advertising personalization.','您发送的信息用于回复询价、讨论样品与报价、了解您提出的产品或 OEM 需求，以及处理相关业务沟通。托管服务商可能处理技术访问信息，用于提供网页、维护安全和排查故障。本网站不出售询价数据，也不将其用于个性化广告。'],
 ['Cookies, Technical Data And The 3D Studio','Cookie、技术信息与 3D 工作室','This website does not add advertising trackers or marketing analytics. Hosting infrastructure may process IP addresses, browser information, timestamps and security logs under its own practices. Model color, finish and catalog selection may appear in the page URL to preserve your choices. Downloaded model images are generated in your browser. Do not place personal or confidential information in shareable URLs.','本网站未添加广告追踪器或营销分析工具。托管基础设施可能按其规则处理 IP 地址、浏览器信息、访问时间和安全日志。模型颜色、质感与色卡选择可能保留在网页网址中，以便恢复选项。模型效果图由浏览器生成下载。请勿在可分享的网址中加入个人或机密信息。'],
 ['Service Providers And External Links','服务商与外部链接','Email, WhatsApp, the social platforms linked from this site and our hosting provider process information according to their respective services and privacy policies. Opening an external product source or color-card link takes you to that provider. Information may be processed in countries different from your own, depending on the service you choose. Review the provider’s privacy information before sending personal data.','邮件、WhatsApp、本网站链接的社交平台及托管服务商按各自服务与隐私政策处理信息。打开外部产品来源或色卡链接时，您会进入相应服务。根据所选服务，信息可能在您所在国家或地区之外处理。发送个人资料前，请查看相应服务商的隐私说明。'],
 ['Retention And Security','保存期限与安全','Inquiry messages received through your chosen communication channel are kept as needed to handle the request and related business records, subject to applicable record-keeping duties. Hosting and communication providers control their own retention periods. You can ask us about information held in our business correspondence or request deletion. Access is limited to relevant business purposes; no internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure.','通过您选择的沟通渠道收到的询价消息，将按处理需求及相关业务记录所需时间保存，并考虑适用的记录保存义务。托管和通信服务商各自管理其保存期限。您可以询问我们在业务沟通中持有的信息，或提出删除请求。信息访问限于相关业务用途，但互联网传输或存储无法保证绝对安全。'],
 ['Your Choices And Requests','您的选择与请求','You may choose not to send an inquiry, correct the message before sending, or contact us to request access, correction or deletion of information you have provided. Depending on your location and applicable rules, additional rights may apply. Send requests to the contact email below and identify the relevant correspondence. We may need reasonable information to verify the request.','您可以不发送询价，在发送前修改消息，或联系公司申请查阅、更正、删除您提供的信息。根据您所在地及适用规则，还可能享有其他权利。请通过下方邮箱提出请求并说明相关业务沟通，我们可能需要合理信息来核实请求。'],
 ['Children And Policy Updates','未成年人及政策更新','This is a business product and wholesale inquiry website, not a service directed at children. If you believe a child has sent personal information, contact us. We may update this notice when website features or data practices change; the updated date appears at the top of this page.','本网站用于商业产品展示与批发询价，并非面向儿童的服务。如您认为儿童向我们发送了个人信息，请联系我们。当网站功能或信息处理方式变化时，我们会更新此政策，并在页首标示更新日期。']
];
---
<Layout title={L('Privacy Policy','隐私政策')} description={L('How YUNNIAN handles website inquiries, technical data and your privacy choices.','了解云辇网站的询价信息、技术数据及隐私选择。')}><article class="container prose"><span class="eyebrow">YUNNIAN / PRIVACY</span><h1>{L('Privacy Policy','隐私政策')}</h1><p>{L('Last Updated: November 21, 2026','更新日期：2026 年 11 月 21 日')}</p>{sections.map(([en,cn,bodyEn,bodyCn])=><section><h2>{L(en,cn)}</h2><p>{L(bodyEn,bodyCn)}</p></section>)}<h2>{L('Contact Us','联系我们')}</h2><p><a href={'mailto:'+company.email}>{company.email}</a><br/><a href={path('/contact/')}>{L('Contact Information','联系信息')}</a></p></article></Layout>
